{"title":"Globe","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Globe","subtitle":"Welcome to #30DayMapChallenge 2022 day 19","date":"2022-11-19","image":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fgazzelloni/30DayMapChallenge/master/2022/day19_globe/day19_globe.png","image-alt":"Globe Map","description":"Globe Map made with {rnaturalearth}","categories":["Globe","rnaturalearth"],"output":"html_document","execute":{"eval":false}},"headingText":"Overview","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n\n`{rnaturalearth}` for making this `Globe Map`.\n\n![Globe](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fgazzelloni/30DayMapChallenge/master/2022/day19_globe/day19_globe.png)\n\n\n```{r}\nlibrary(tidyverse)\nlibrary(rnaturalearth)\n```\n\n\n```{r}\n# world data full \nworld_full <- ne_countries(scale = \"medium\", returnclass = \"sf\")\n# world lat&long\nworld<-map_data(map = \"world\")\n```\n\n\n```{r}\nmy_world_data<- world %>%\n  full_join(world_full, by = c(\"region\"=\"name\")) %>%\n  select(long,lat,group,order,region,region_wb)\n```\n\n\n```{r}\n# grob for globe water\ng <- grid::circleGrob(gp = grid::gpar(fill = \"#9ad6f0\",color=\"gray30\"))\n```\n\n\n```{r}\nworld<-ggplot() +\n  geom_polygon(data=my_world_data,\n               aes(x=long,y=lat,group=group),\n               fill=\"gray30\",color=\"black\",size=0.09) +\n  coord_map(\"ortho\", orientation = c(65.85, -130.21,0)) + \n  theme_void() \n\nworld\n```\n\n\n```{r}\nlibrary(cowplot)\nglobe <- ggdraw() +\n  draw_grob(g, scale = 1,x = 0,y = 0) +\n  draw_plot(world) +\n  draw_label(\"Globe\",x=0.1,y=0.93,\n             size=22,\n             color=\"#9ad6f0\")+\n  draw_label(\"#30DayMapChallenge 2022 Day 19: Globe\\nDataSource: {rnaturalearth} | Map: Federica Gazzelloni (@fgazzelloni)\",\n             x=0.99,y=0.02,size=6,\n             hjust=1,\n             color=\"#9ad6f0\")\n\nglobe\n```\n\n\n```{r}\nggsave(\"day19_globe.png\",\n       width=7.5,\n       height= 7.5,\n       dpi=320,\n       bg=\"grey10\")\n\n\n```\n\n\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n# Overview\n\n`{rnaturalearth}` for making this `Globe Map`.\n\n![Globe](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fgazzelloni/30DayMapChallenge/master/2022/day19_globe/day19_globe.png)\n\n\n```{r}\nlibrary(tidyverse)\nlibrary(rnaturalearth)\n```\n\n\n```{r}\n# world data full \nworld_full <- ne_countries(scale = \"medium\", returnclass = \"sf\")\n# world lat&long\nworld<-map_data(map = \"world\")\n```\n\n\n```{r}\nmy_world_data<- world %>%\n  full_join(world_full, by = c(\"region\"=\"name\")) %>%\n  select(long,lat,group,order,region,region_wb)\n```\n\n\n```{r}\n# grob for globe water\ng <- grid::circleGrob(gp = grid::gpar(fill = \"#9ad6f0\",color=\"gray30\"))\n```\n\n\n```{r}\nworld<-ggplot() +\n  geom_polygon(data=my_world_data,\n               aes(x=long,y=lat,group=group),\n               fill=\"gray30\",color=\"black\",size=0.09) +\n  coord_map(\"ortho\", orientation = c(65.85, -130.21,0)) + \n  theme_void() \n\nworld\n```\n\n\n```{r}\nlibrary(cowplot)\nglobe <- ggdraw() +\n  draw_grob(g, scale = 1,x = 0,y = 0) +\n  draw_plot(world) +\n  draw_label(\"Globe\",x=0.1,y=0.93,\n             size=22,\n             color=\"#9ad6f0\")+\n  draw_label(\"#30DayMapChallenge 2022 Day 19: Globe\\nDataSource: {rnaturalearth} | Map: Federica Gazzelloni (@fgazzelloni)\",\n             x=0.99,y=0.02,size=6,\n             hjust=1,\n             color=\"#9ad6f0\")\n\nglobe\n```\n\n\n```{r}\nggsave(\"day19_globe.png\",\n       width=7.5,\n       height= 7.5,\n       dpi=320,\n       bg=\"grey10\")\n\n\n```\n\n\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":false,"cache":null,"freeze":true,"echo":true,"output":"html_document","warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"